---
description: YAGNI and KISS
alwaysApply: true
---

- No speculative generic: start concrete; generalize only at the 2nd call site.
- No `pub` without a current caller; `cargo udeps` and unused-pub lint in CI.
- Cyclomatic complexity ≤ 10; nesting ≤ 4. Decompose otherwise.
- Iterator chains > 4 stages must be refactored for readability.
- Feature flags only when a real consumer requires exclusion.
